de dentro da CIA.","e":"I can't... because I helped create the rogue group inside the CIA.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.918233,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c491f752be2f7f3006b3669b686fcba9","i":"ada8e8a2645b17c6e070a92b4f6dce07","r":"6394046:6880842:215 216:5098560","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6394046","6880842","215 216"],"w":["leaf",0]}],[{"t":"É possível... que ele não saiba de nenhum outro rebelde?","e":"Is it possible he does not know of any other rebels to speak of?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.807689,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"7a02b4cd11e783532055fcb7d261d6ec","i":"316f82017b6a3d6066c388171b29ea60","r":"4236884:6357939:269:1140770","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4236884","6357939","269"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não sei que mais este rebelde lhe poderá dizer, minha senhora.","e":"I do not know what more this rebel can tell you, my lady.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.888484,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8f38fbbede8f4f58ed03019becc80c14","i":"40458f03ac07db32e1673fb539718ccd","r":"4741400:6349481:77:1869035","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4741400","6349481","77"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Senhor, a nave rebelde já não aparece nos sensores.","e":"Sir, the rebel ship is not registering on our scanners.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.746979,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"123e61499f8b80944ae292e0b1da3c6f","i":"de0f5ef88efe1f1e5d4bb90598ac013c","r":"5654976:6748952:383:3944820","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5654976","6748952","383"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Este rebelde deverá ter uma morte bastante agonizante.","e":"This rebel must bear a death most agonizing.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.815896,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x"